Treatment Explanation: Pushing past your body's strict limits has caused an acute energy crisis in your muscles, leading to the twitching and profound weakness. This is a severe physical crash. The muscle relaxant will stop the twitching, but the only true cure is aggressive rest and replacing fluids to protect your kidneys.
Actionable Steps: Drink at least 2 liters of water over the next 12 hours. Use your mobility aids for absolutely all movements around the house. Do not attempt to return to work until cleared by your regular doctor.

